/farmland-atlas/louisiana/lafourche-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Lafourche Parish runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, and March to April came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 45% of normal for August to September and 47% for November to December. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 167% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 11258 had its driest year in 2023 at 54%.</p>"}
